| `xcrun xctrace record` | Headless trace capture |
| `idevicesyslog` | Real-device log stream |
| Console.app | macOS-side iOS device logs |
| `xcrun devicectl device snapshot` | Real-device screenshot |
| Charles / mitmproxy | Network debug (real device pair + CA cert) |

